Package: damnbot
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Damn-Bot contributors <maintainers@damnbot.dev>
Depends: ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/damnbot/damnbot
Description: Single-binary AI assistant with tools, gateway, and TUI
 Damn-Bot ships one binary, local storage, and signed releases. This package
 installs the official release binary; install.sh verifies checksums and the
 ed25519 signature before installation.
